  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "WJb 0.105.0\n            - Simplified builder API with Create(...) and CreateAsync(...)\n            - Explicit job workflow engine\n            - Typed actions and payload binding\n            - Constructor-based dependency injection\n            - Action chaining via ActionResult and JobCommand\n            - In-memory job storage\n            - Retry, scheduling, progress, and cancellation support\n            - IWJb / IWJbExecutor runtime model\n            - Deterministic and testable architecture\n            - Improved source layout and API organization",
